{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ages of Cataria</strong>\u00a0is a cozy story generation game. Every story begins with a family embarking and then settling on a new land called &quot;Cataria&quot;. Here, the villagers will have to build out their comforts and find their roles in this new society.  <br><br>Over time, others will join your settlement, and some will find love and start new families around town. Experience these generational stories as your villagers age over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/1771cb790ffd149a52a2dde895635917.avif?t=1762362034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras_big/1771cb790ffd149a52a2dde895635917.webp?t=1762362034 width=1600 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers will age before your eyes. In their lifetimes, they will leave a lasting mark on the village by forming meaningful relationships, experiencing life-changing events, and contributing their unique skills. See their children grow and leave their own unique mark on the town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.poster.avif?t=1762362034\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.webm?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.mp4?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/df4ce62fb350102f85155183cd5ae147.avif?t=1762362034\" width=577 height=126 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your town, fulfilling your town\u2019s needs for shelter, food, and resources. As your town grows, so will its desires. Decorate your town to enhance its appearance, and villagers may start to take notice as well. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.poster.avif?t=1762362034\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.webm?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.mp4?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/cdab619e9bf496b16e7db61c38b51ea6.avif?t=1762362034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras_big/cdab619e9bf496b16e7db61c38b51ea6.webp?t=1762362034 width=1600 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every so often, villagers will encounter events around the village. These will pop up around the map and happen randomly, giving the villager a chance to experience a unique event. These events can be as small as finding a unique insect and as impactful as marriage.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/466ecb83ddf252dbf4404358b21585ba.poster.avif?t=1762362034\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/466ecb83ddf252dbf4404358b21585ba.webm?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/466ecb83ddf252dbf4404358b21585ba.mp4?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/9a20f944a9786ff201de6ec7f2403c55.avif?t=1762362034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras_big/9a20f944a9786ff201de6ec7f2403c55.webp?t=1762362034 width=1600 height=348 /></span>Death is part of telling a generational story. Everyone\u2019s story eventually ends, and in Cataria, that is no different. Once a villager passes, their spirit will enter your town's spirit tree, which will grow with your town as more spirits pass away. This provides your villagers with a place to gather, remember their ancestors, and offer gifts to the afterlife.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/ecdb5a5fb8ba6b230a2d25fd4548bc90.avif?t=1762362034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras_big/ecdb5a5fb8ba6b230a2d25fd4548bc90.avif?t=1762362034 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1634390?t=1762362034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1634390?t=1762362034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/c2d8be648b0b50bfc38d8da2b6cd34531ea3c40d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762362034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/c2d8be648b0b50bfc38d8da2b6cd34531ea3c40d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762362034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/ebd244d60e7225ee5993a4db01889698.avif?t=1762362034\" width=1118 height=2024 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ages of Cataria</strong>\u00a0is a cozy story generation game. Every story begins with a family embarking and then settling on a new land called &quot;Cataria&quot;. Here, the villagers will have to build out their comforts and find their roles in this new society.  <br><br>Over time, others will join your settlement, and some will find love and start new families around town. Experience these generational stories as your villagers age over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/1771cb790ffd149a52a2dde895635917.avif?t=1762362034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras_big/1771cb790ffd149a52a2dde895635917.webp?t=1762362034 width=1600 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers will age before your eyes. In their lifetimes, they will leave a lasting mark on the village by forming meaningful relationships, experiencing life-changing events, and contributing their unique skills. See their children grow and leave their own unique mark on the town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.poster.avif?t=1762362034\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.webm?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/affc5ae0196fc518b234a2afee56f325.mp4?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/df4ce62fb350102f85155183cd5ae147.avif?t=1762362034\" width=577 height=126 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your town, fulfilling your town\u2019s needs for shelter, food, and resources. As your town grows, so will its desires. Decorate your town to enhance its appearance, and villagers may start to take notice as well. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.poster.avif?t=1762362034\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.webm?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634390/extras/005f4499f73be445a6ab72bcd93b7c5f.mp4?t=1762362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla